    "description": "Offline, deterministic bioinformatics command-line tool for auditing protein FASTA sequences and PDB coordinate files. Analyzes amino-acid composition and ambiguous residues in FASTA files, and inventories observed C-alpha residues in the first PDB model. Produces structured JSON reports with source SHA-256 digests and bounded quality warnings. Supports reproducible execution and CWL workflow integration. Does not predict protein structures, assess folding accuracy, or validate molecular geometry.",
    "documentation": [
        {
            "note": "Installation, ls-bio protein-fasta and protein-pdb commands, supported inputs, bounded JSON outputs, 8 MB input limit, CWL wrappers and stated limitations",
            "type": [
                "User manual"
            ],
            "url": "https://github.com/lostlight530/life-science-ecosystem-lab/blob/main/bio_tool/README.md"
        }
    ],
